     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;geomorph R package&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-r-pack...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\ngeomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485117285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cxY2xPoIoWWiSw8yYzAOd\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/CAD8ohKR3N5KWKKfALW7AZJdXNS%2BfX9D2G09SdX0Jhz2wKLutOA%40mail.gmail.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/CAD8ohKR3N5KWKKfALW7AZJdXNS%252BfX9D2G09SdX0Jhz2wKLutOA%2540mail.gmail.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485117285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0U-0jSj1T4ZEPhe9zcnIhQ\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/CAD8ohKR3N5KWKKfALW7AZJdXNS%2BfX9D2G09SdX0Jhz2wKLutOA%40mail.gmail.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485117285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xxOqJJr8ShsS_dUfBXquM\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
