  {
   "id": "mUqYyPWfBQAJ",
   "from": "Adams, Dean [EEOBS]",
   "author": "4d71c6e24fb21497",
   "date": "2019-02-22T14:15:27Z",
   "subject": "RE: [geomorph-r-package] Re: TEST OF HOMOGENEITY OF SLOPES (ALLOMETRY)",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Nicole,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">As specified in your code yes. More technically, the function performs pairwise comparisons from the full model, relative to the reduced model, where both models\r\n are specified by the user. You have specified Csize*species as the full model, and Csize as your reduced. Using just the covariate (Csize) as the reduced model is equivalent to a common slopes model (i.e. parallel regression lines).<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dean<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Director of Graduate Education, EEB Program<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Professor<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Iowa State University<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><a href=\"https://www.eeob.iastate.edu/faculty/adams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eeob.iastate.edu/faculty/adams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485117288000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LoBvgC4fvkY9_XCXTq02n\">https://www.eeob.iastate.edu/faculty/adams/</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" ta