     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><b>Subject:</b> [geomorph-r-package] Re: TEST OF HOMOGENEITY OF SLOPES (ALLOMETRY)<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
